  <item>
    <title>#40 关于重启：一个人出发的时刻，我才真正开始和自己说话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69041f8665ab4ef684b71a0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69041f8665ab4ef684b71a0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 02:34:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有人勇敢的出发去远方，有人安静的听完他们的故事，也被点亮了一点，找到了重启键。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期小岛广播站我们邀请到了PMPM偏偏的创始人闪烁与文一起和毛栗子来聊聊重启的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也希望岛民们可以在低谷时期找到内心的重启键，再次出发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也相信：【重启】可以解决90%的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴⌚️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 无人区的夜晚，生死决策与斧头人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> 独自旅行时的踌躇与日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> 创业是人生最艰难且精彩的一次探险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 对自我重启的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3603">60:03</a> 我开始真正和自己说话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCmZQMpyxQ0v9GB4YFeMdRUnRBV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrhIP6_g7GhpiPIQOG36Hms65qRP.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
