    <guid isPermaLink="false">682c187d457b22ce0d9723e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 06:00:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>心意微微甜，故事兑咖啡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在520不去讨论爱情有多么的宏大。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期小岛广播站，毛栗子与nemo分别分享了各自4个爱物背后的故事来表达内心深处难以言说的情感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也希望在这个特别时间里用我们的自由表达，与大家共享爱意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 关于童年的陪伴、书桌前的天真与25岁的小熊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a>关于戒指与闪婚的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a>关于实习生的信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a>真爱是不必在一起的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a>关于遗物与死亡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljpMWUbQ41HwCCACJdxU78NNZTfo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhbRHCjJAIVQDeeNws1D_63im7Z-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM: change your mind - castlebeat</span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
