  <item>
    <title>#30 温暖的人先享受世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658d470bcab6086ec16c8227</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658d470bcab6086ec16c8227</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Dec 2023 09:59:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近“xx的人先享受世界”的句式开始流行起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于小岛广播站来说，脑海里第一个跳出来的词是“温暖”</span></p><span></span><p><span>不同于其他特质，温暖是可以传递下去的，你待他人温暖，世界也会以温暖报之你</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像是往一汪平静的池水扔下石子，泛起阵阵涟漪</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然外面寒风呼啸，但我们的心都因为这些美好的小事变得暖融融的</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起在寒冷的冬天，聊聊那些在日常中感受到的温暖时刻吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📑 收听指南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 能来听这场演唱会真是太好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 被骗了2000块钱，是我太傻了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 网友说要飞来杭州陪我，然后就真的来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 虽然素未谋面，但依然能感受到来自对方的温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 温暖的人=讨好型人格？=中央空调？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 愉快地接受爱的人，自然也奉献爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 冬天，和温暖的书影音作伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 本期节目提及的书影音笔记：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《蜡笔小新》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《老友记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《四个春天》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《横道世之介》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《带壳的牡蛎是大人的心脏》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《献给阿尔吉侬的花束》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤 主播及嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly95b25ncHVjb2ZmZWUuZmVpc2h1LmNuL3NwYWNlL2FwaS9ib3gvc3RyZWFtL2Rvd25sb2FkL2FzeW5jY29kZS8_Y29kZT1ZV1prTmpWaU1ESXpaVE13T1dRM05ESTJaak5sWmpnME1UaGlaR1ZrWWpGZll6RkZha0pQYUhkTmVVcFFSM2RSWWtkd2NUVlFUVFptVFcxd2VrdzBOa3hmVkc5clpXNDZWRzVzVjJKUGRVbFFiM0pSZFVsNFlYQkVWMk5EY0RkMmJrSmtYekUzTURNM05UY3pPVE02TVRjd016YzJNRGs1TTE5V05B"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>以爱的名义 — 一台好戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>angels we have heard on high grand</span></p><span></span><p><span>ave maria js bach charles gounod</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📡 联络方式</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/QQ音乐/荔枝搜索</span><strong><span>「小岛广播站」</span></strong><span>即可收听</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有任何意见或建议，可以在公众号/微博/小红书搜索</span><strong><span>「永璞咖啡」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
