  <item>
    <title>#27 把低谷当作一个休息的场所</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6502c4ac96875579714aa5ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6502c4ac96875579714aa5ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Sep 2023 08:30:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活就像一辆过山车🎢有高峰，也会有低谷</span></p><span></span><p><span>越是想摆脱它，越是像影子一样追着你跑</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有当我们真正愿意面对内心的低谷，接受其中的挑战和教训，才能逐渐超越自己，实现内心的成长与转变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期就想和大家来聊聊各自的「至暗时刻」，以及是如何度过它们的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许等到很久以后回过头再看，你会发现这些不过是漫漫人生中一个很小的插曲。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📑 收听指南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 在恋爱与工作中陷入僵局，是生活常态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 满足社会期待的挣扎时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 一场车祸的意外时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 初入社会的迷茫时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 异国他乡的孤独时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 进京艺考的崩溃时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> 不想按部就班，但也会因为和别人不同感到不安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 调整情绪状态的N种方法📝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a> 谢谢朋友，做我们的情绪充电站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3674">1:01:14</a> 给正在经历低谷的你一些小关爱小鼓励✨</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤 主播及嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly95b25ncHVjb2ZmZWUuZmVpc2h1LmNuL3NwYWNlL2FwaS9ib3gvc3RyZWFtL2Rvd25sb2FkL2FzeW5jY29kZS8_Y29kZT1PR00yTTJZNFptRXhaV1poT0dNd1kyWXhZVGhpTm1FeU1qUmhZVFF5TVRSZlkwUlhaWGx2U21KMGFuWlBXbGc0YUdjemVIaHVVVkZHVUc1cFlqWnBORkJmVkc5clpXNDZXR05XY1dKTlpFWkNiMFJPZWtoNFdIVjZWR050U0VONWJrcG9YekUyT1RRMk9EQXhNRFE2TVRZNU5EWTRNemN3TkY5V05B"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>金子隆博 - みんなの散歩道</span></p><span></span><p><span>Krisu - Lights</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📡 联络方式</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/QQ音乐/荔枝搜索</span><strong><span>「小岛广播站」</span></strong><span>即可收听</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有任何意见或建议，可以在公众号/微博/小红书搜索</span><strong><span>「永璞咖啡」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
