  <item>
    <title>#26 一边乱花钱，一边学省钱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ec63bd3fa4090b7477de32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ec63bd3fa4090b7477de32</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 09:07:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有些人在拼命花钱，有些人在努力省钱，这两种看似矛盾的消费观，蕴藏着各自的大智慧💡</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的消费观在疫情这几年发生了什么变化？有哪些钱是必须花？哪些钱又是可以省的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们一边反思这些年贡献过的智商税，一边总结如何在消费降级的2023，花钱花得开心，花得值得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👛祝每个人都能做金钱的“主人”，掌握花钱的主动权和理性。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📑 收听指南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 从花2000块染头，到自己开始剪刘海了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 塔罗牌算智商税嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 这些钱该花还是得花！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> 机票/酒店/游玩项目...旅行达人省钱干货大公开💰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> 如何对抗「沪币」伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 现在的年轻人更愿意花钱投资自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">43:24</a> 消费心路历程：随便买→舍不得买→买真正需要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 闲鱼累计卖了30万闲置？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3314">55:14</a> 适度拥有，幸福感会被放大</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 影单《钱断情始》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤 主播及嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly95b25ncHVjb2ZmZWUuZmVpc2h1LmNuL3NwYWNlL2FwaS9ib3gvc3RyZWFtL2Rvd25sb2FkL2FzeW5jY29kZS8_Y29kZT1Oakl5WWpGaE5EWmlNR1U0Wm1JelptTTJaVFl6WVRVNE1tWmtaak5oWkRSZmJVcDZVRkpYUTJGR1p6SmhRVzgxTldOYVRUaGpPVWd6VG1wWFdtTldaMVpmVkc5clpXNDZXRzlOUjJJemNVOHhiMU5hUWxKNGJEbFdUMk00Y3pKaGJteGxYekUyT1RNeU1UTTBNelE2TVRZNU16SXhOekF6TkY5V05B"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大間々昂 - 世捨て人</span></p><span></span><p><span>大間々昂 - 清貧女子</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📡 联络方式</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/QQ音乐搜索</span><strong><span>「小岛广播站」</span></strong><span>即可收听</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有任何意见或建议，可以在公众号/微博/小红书搜索</span><strong><span>「永璞咖啡」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
