  <item>
    <title>#25 在盛夏里释放多巴胺，运动起来就对了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64de0f03e490c5dee5b9128f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64de0f03e490c5dee5b9128f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Aug 2023 12:13:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>相信有很多人一到夏天就立下了运动减肥的flag🏃🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>但运动的目的，很多时候不止是为了减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span>从中获得的正反馈，让我们快乐健康，变得积极向上</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其是在盛夏，大汗淋漓地运动一场别提有多爽了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期从运动小白到达人，带你一步步进阶，一起释放快乐多巴胺 come on💪🏻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📑 收听指南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 运动，但目的各不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 如何从畏难到享受运动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 别再盯着体重！自然健康的线条才更美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a> 想运动，但是很难启动该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 总是容易半途而废很难坚持下去怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a> 合适新手的开启运动的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a> 运动期间如何安排饮食？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 先了解自己的身体状态，多听从你身体的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a>不要抱有太强的目的性，反而能养成习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 运动达人也会有身材焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 接纳自己，才能从运动里享受并收获更多快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 运动教会了我们_______</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤 主播及嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly95b25ncHVjb2ZmZWUuZmVpc2h1LmNuL3NwYWNlL2FwaS9ib3gvc3RyZWFtL2Rvd25sb2FkL2FzeW5jY29kZS8_Y29kZT1abUZpTURWa1pqSXlNemd4TmpVME9EZ3lNemhpTWpNeFpqTTRNelJqT0RaZlFtTjNhbmRNUlVsUWJ6RkVUSGQzV2xjMlF6VmlXVGxzUVdzelZHUXpjbVZmVkc5clpXNDZURVpNYjJKd1QwNVNiM3BpVVdsNFdYQkhjbU4xYmxrNGJrSmpYekUyT1RJeU56UXpOVEU2TVRZNU1qSTNOemsxTVY5V05B"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Happy Day</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fun Times Ahead</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📡 联络方式</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/QQ音乐搜索</span><strong><span>「小岛广播站」</span></strong><span>即可收听</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有任何意见或建议，可以在公众号/微博/小红书搜索</span><strong><span>「永璞咖啡」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
